    "enUS": {
      "dialogue": {
        "55605d7cffea8fa773aa": "Your talent is beyond my own, friend. Speak with Tarn here; his knowledge of leather is much greater than mine. I'm sure he would welcome another student.",
        "878e58a3bc2f7e07e1c7": "Train me.",
        "be062a472af9e1ee26c6": "Cleanse your hands before you begin any project. Staining the leather with blood or dirt would take away from its natural beauty.",
        "d464669902149ee89c37": "Cairne himself lives here, they say. Once I have finished crafting a fitting gift, I will seek him out. Perhaps he will have words of wisdom for me."
      },
      "name": "Mak",
      "subName": "Journeyman Leatherworker",
      "translationMetadata": {
        "fields": {
